message: |
  If you use this code or its results in academic work, please cite
  both the dissertation (preferred for the methodology) and this
  software (for the implementation).
title: "Deep Hedging under Rough Volatility: Robustness to Model Misspecification (code release)"
abstract: |
  Reference implementation of the deep hedging framework for
  European options under rough Bergomi dynamics with proportional
  transaction costs, evaluated against Black-Scholes and Heston
  PDE delta benchmarks across four model-risk axes. Includes the
  hybrid-scheme rough volatility simulator, the residual-block
  deep hedger, and a 5-seed canonical baseline reproducible to
  byte-identical precision under the App A.7 environment pins.
